      "message": "If you have not submitted your changes to us, or to upstream, you don\u0027t know if they are acceptable or not, please do so.\n\nAnd you can not build this as a module for GKI 1, we do not support modules for this release, so you have no dependency on these symbols.  I think you might be confused as to how GKI 1 is working, please see the documentation about this.\n\nI\u0027ll close this out now, as this isn\u0027t valid for the android11-5.4 tree.",
